<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of June 3.</p>
<p>				    June 3/June 2   June 3/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES* _______ ________ __________ _____________</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.09		 7.00</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 5.17</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.29		10.11</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    1.20		58.80</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES _______ ___________ ___________ __________</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.49		31.26</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -0.54		31.77</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.29		12.07</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.83		28.34</p>
<p>NET ASSETS ______ _________ ________ _________ _____________</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.39		38.75</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -0.53		37.07</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.65		20.88</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    2.08		99.37</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas) _____ _______ _______ _______</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,276,784,936,761</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,929,183,529,479</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,007,995,545,813</p>
<p>  International funds			    95,022,776,584</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    244,583,084,884</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
